ghtbox="true" href="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvMzUzMzI5Ni8yMTA0NDYyNS5wbmc=/original/Q%2FigTV.png" target="_blank"><img data-screenshot_id="21044625" class="screenshot" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvMzUzMzI5Ni8yMTA0NDYyNS5wbmc=/147x117%23/w0aD64.png"/></a></div></div><div class="main_column"><section class="visit_game"><h2>Play game</h2><a class="button fat play_btn" href="https://loaloa.itch.io/2">バースト姉妹のうまい棒生産計画&#039;s itch.io page<svg stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" role="img" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="24" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin="round" version="1.1" width="24" class="svgicon icon_arrow_up_right" fill="none"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></a></section><section class="field_responses"><p><strong>ジャンル</strong><br/><span>中編見るゲ</span></p><p><strong>使用ツール</strong><br/><span>steam2003</span></p><p><strong>配信・動画化の可否</strong><br/><span>配信:可　投稿:自分でやります</span></p><p><strong>作者</strong><br/><span>ナナメティックスレイヤー</span></p><p><strong>作者コメント</strong><br/>今回は作者の好きなキャラ同窓会です 興味ないキャラが興味ないこと喋ってて 少々退屈かもしれません  想定視聴時間は30分前後 途中セーブ５回  今回から2003マニアクスパッチで作成 誤検知が出たらゴメス  使えそうな矛グラがあったら好きに物故抜いてください</p><p><strong>感想・バグ報告先</strong><br/><a href="http://jbbs.shitaraba.net/bbs/read.cgi/game/61468/1746436950/l50" rel="nofollow">http://jbbs.shitaraba.net/bbs/read.cgi/game/61468/1746436950/l50</a></p></section><section class="jam_comment_form"><h2>Leave a comment</h2><p class="form_placeholder"><a href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fvip-gw2025%2Frate%2F3533296" data-register_action="comment">Log in with itch.io</a> to leave a comment.</p></section><section class="jam_comment_list" id="comments"><h2>Comments</h2><div class="community_topic_posts_widget base_widget" id="community_topic_posts_7229899"><div class="community_post_list_widget base_widget" id="community_post_list_1656047"><div data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:13372085,&quot;id&quot;:12822676}" class="community_post sidebar_avatar" id="post-12822676"><div class="post_anchor" id="first-post"></div><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/tkooler"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/tkooler">tkooler</a></span><a href="/jam/vip-gw2025/rate/3481228"><span class="author_flag">Submitted</span></a><span title="2025-05-10 13:30:06" class="post_date"><a href="/post/12822676">1 year ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"><span class="upvotes">(+1)</span></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>元気が出る内容でとても良かったです。思ったよりも繋がりは沢山あるんだなと思いました</p></div><div class="related_submission"><a href="/jam/vip-gw2025/rate/3481228"><div class="lazy_image_widget base_widget" id="lazy_image_2906709"></div></a><div class="submission_summary"><div class="sub">Submitted</div><a href="/jam/vip-gw2025/rate/3481228">もしも生活保護だったら</a></div></div><div class="post_footer"><a class="post_action vote_btn" data-register_action="community_vote" href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fvip-gw2025%2Frate%2F3533296"><span class="icon-like"></span><span class="like_text"> Like</span></a><a href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fvip-gw2025%2Frate%2F3533296" data-register_action="community_reply" class="post_action reply_btn">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:13316430,&quot;id&quot;:12815252}" class="community_post sidebar_avatar" id="post-12815252"><div class="post_anchor" id="last-post"></div><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/vipgw2025"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwNzAxNDg1LnBuZw==/80x80%23/mZd46t.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/vipgw2025">vipgw2025</a></span><span class="author_flag owner" data-s